{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>For in the cloud I appear.</b> In this manner — to speak to Moses; and in other generations, to call those prepared for prophecy, as in the case of Samuel, who said: וּשְׁמוּאֵל שֹׁכֵב בְּהֵיכַל ה׳ אֲשֶׁר שָׁם אֲרוֹן אֱלֹהִים, וַיִּקְרָא ה׳ אֶל שְׁמוּאֵל (1 Samuel 3:3–4)."], :book :leviticus, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 16, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:36:25.040866449Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}